                Cluster navigation rule:
                01 → left: back to the guide, right: next deep dive
                02–05 → left: previous deep dive, right: next deep dive
                06 → left: previous deep dive, right: back to the guide
              */}
              <nav class="qc-cluster" aria-label="Guide navigation">
